{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"zai-org/CodeGeeX4","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/110","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/110/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/110/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/110/events","html_url":"https://github.com/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/110","id":3022590495,"node_id":"I_kwDOMRdAoc60KRIf","number":110,"title":"【BUG】remote ssh登录到远程时导致远程机器所有python进程被杀死","user":{"login":"lishaogang","id":15699214,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1Njk5MjE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15699214?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang","html_url":"https://github.com/lishaogang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-04-27T02:20:16Z","updated_at":"2025-04-27T07:02:05Z","closed_at":"2025-04-27T07:02:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# 1. 问题描述及复现步骤\n**描述：**\nvscode安装CodeGeeX插件后，使用vscode通过remote-ssh打开一个远程机器上任意项目，将导致该远程机器上的所有python进程被关闭（即使该python进行并非在vscode中启动）。  \n\nvscode 远程端仅安装了CodeGeeX 插件，且尝试卸载vscode、删除远程机器.vscode-server均无法解决问题。  \n\n经过反复验证，该问题可100%复现。\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b19f7b47-3a7b-47b8-8e39-d129ecad6d96)\n\n**复现步骤：**\n- 安装vscode，安装codegeex插件，配置remote-ssh\n- 关闭vscode\n- 在远程机器启动一个python进程（使用其它非vscode终端，或在该远程机器本地终端启动）\n- 打开vscode\n- 使用vscode打开该远程机器上任意项目\n- python进程将被杀死\n\n# 2. 版本信息\n## 2.1 vscode \n**Version: 1.99.3 (user setup)**\n**Commit: 17baf841131aa23349f217ca7c570c76ee87b957**\nDate: 2025-04-15T23:18:46.076Z\nElectron: 34.3.2\nElectronBuildId: 11161073\nChromium: 132.0.6834.210\nNode.js: 20.18.3\nV8: 13.2.152.41-electron.0\nOS: Windows_NT x64 10.0.26100\n\n\n## 2.2 CodeGeeX 插件\nName: CodeGeeX: AI Coding Assistant\nId: AMiner.codegeex\nDescription: CodeGeeX is an AI-based coding assistant, which can suggest code in the current or following lines.  It is powered by a large-scale multilingual code generation model with 13 billion parameters, pretrained on a large code corpus of more than 20 programming languages.\n**Version: 2.22.3**\nPublisher: Zhipu AI\nVS Marketplace Link: https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items/?itemName=aminer.codegeex\n\n## 2.3 remote ssh插件\nName: Remote - SSH\nId: ms-vscode-remote.remote-ssh\nDescription: Open any folder on a remote machine using SSH and take advantage of VS Code's full feature set.\nVersion: 0.119.0\nPublisher: Microsoft\nVS Marketplace Link: https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items/?itemName=ms-vscode-remote.remote-ssh\n\n## 2.4 远程机器操作系统版本\nDistributor ID: Ubuntu\nDescription:    Ubuntu 22.04.5 LTS\nRelease:        22.04\nCodename:       jammy\nLinux 6.2.0-26-generic #26~22.04.1-Ubuntu SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu Jul 13 16:27:29 UTC 2 x86_64 x86_64 x86_64 GNU/Linux\n\n## 2.5 本地机器操作系统版本\n版本\tWindows 11 家庭中文版\n版本号\t24H2\n安装日期\t‎2024/‎12/‎5\n操作系统版本\t26100.3775\n体验\tWindows 功能体验包 1000.26100.66.0\n\n## 2.6 网络配置\n本地机器与远程机器在局域网的不同网段\n本地机器ip：192.168.a.b，子网掩码：255.255.255.0\n远程机器ip：192.168.c.d，子网掩码：255.255.255.0\n未使用网络代理/vpn\n\n## 2.7 远程机器python进程测试代码\n```\nimport time\ndef main():\n    while True:\n        now = time.time()\n        fmt_time_str = time.strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\", time.localtime(now))\n        print('[INFO]:', fmt_time_str, \"this is a python process started from local terminal\")\n        time.sleep(1)\n\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    main()\n```","closed_by":{"login":"lishaogang","id":15699214,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1Njk5MjE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15699214?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang","html_url":"https://github.com/lishaogang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lishaogang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/110/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/110/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/comments/2832941244","html_url":"https://github.com/zai-org/CodeGeeX4/issues/110#